{"id":"A2-L006","title":"Past Simple (irregular): introduction","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U01","focus":"Past Simple — irregular — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Past Simple — irregular — introdução","pron":"Ligação entre palavras","verbs":[],"pv":["check out"],"expr":[],"words":["patience","silly","delayed","conductor","compartment","aisle seat","overhead bin","turbulence","landing","take-off","arrivals","departures","information desk","ticket office","vending machine","carriage"],"field":"Viagens","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escuta","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 6 · Past Simple (irregular): introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Past Simple — irregular — introdução.","**Phrasal verbs:** check out.","**Pronúncia:** Ligação entre palavras.","**10 palavras novas** (viagens).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar verbos irregulares no passado e fazer check-out."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["patience","paciência"],["silly","bobo"],["delayed","atrasado (transporte)"],["conductor","condutor"],["compartment","compartimento"],["aisle seat","aisle seat"],["overhead bin","overhead bin"],["turbulence","turbulence"],["landing","landing"],["take-off","take-off"],["arrivals","arrivals"],["departures","departures"],["information desk","information desk"],["ticket office","ticket office"],["vending machine","vending machine"],["carriage","carriage"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Day We Missed the Train","paras":["We **woke** late, **took** a taxi and **ran** to the station. The train **left** at nine, and we **saw** it go. We **felt** silly, but the clerk **said**, “There is another at ten.”","We **went** to a café, **ate** pastries and **did** crosswords. At the hotel we **checked out** and **made** a new plan. Missing a train **taught** us patience."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Travel Weekly","gloss":[["pastry","massa folhada"],["crossword","palavras cruzadas"],["patience","paciência"],["silly","bobo"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"They woke late.","ans":"T","why":"“woke late.”"},{"q":"They caught the nine o’clock train.","ans":"F","why":"saw it go."},{"q":"They ate pastries.","ans":"T","why":"ate pastries."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“patience” means…","opts":["paciência","pressa","sorte"],"ans":0,"why":"patience."},{"q":"“silly” means…","opts":["bobo","triste","cansado"],"ans":0,"why":"silly."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Irregular past forms","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Presente","Passado"],"rows":[["wake","**woke**"],["take","**took**"],["run","**ran**"],["leave","**left**"],["see","**saw**"],["go","**went**"],["eat","**ate**"],["make","**made**"]],"cap":"Irregular past forms"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Irregulares não seguem -ed: memorize em grupos (*took, took; woke, woke; went, gone*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We ___ a taxi. (take)","a":"took","why":"irregular."},{"s":"The train ___ at nine. (leave)","a":"left","why":"irregular."},{"s":"We ___ pastries. (eat)","a":"ate","why":"irregular."},{"s":"We ___ out of the hotel. (check)","a":"checked","why":"regular.","say":"We checked out"}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["pastry","massa folhada"],["crossword","palavras cruzadas"],["patience","paciência"],["silly","bobo"],["platform","plataforma"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["nine","Yes","It","left","at"],"ans":"Yes It left at nine","pt":"Sim. Saiu às nove."},{"words":["we","miss","the","train","Did"],"ans":"Did we miss the train","pt":"Perdemos o trem?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"patience","pos":"word","pt":"paciência","ex":"Have patience.","expt":"Tenha paciência."},{"w":"silly","pos":"word","pt":"bobo","ex":"A silly mistake.","expt":"Um erro bobo."},{"w":"delayed","pos":"word","pt":"atrasado (transporte)","ex":"The train is delayed.","expt":"O trem está atrasado."},{"w":"conductor","pos":"word","pt":"condutor","ex":"The conductor smiled.","expt":"O condutor sorriu."},{"w":"compartment","pos":"word","pt":"compartimento","ex":"A quiet compartment.","expt":"Um compartimento silencioso."},{"w":"aisle seat","pos":"word","pt":"aisle seat","ex":"assento no corredor","expt":"An aisle seat."},{"w":"overhead bin","pos":"word","pt":"overhead bin","ex":"bagageiro","expt":"The overhead bin."},{"w":"turbulence","pos":"word","pt":"turbulence","ex":"turbulência","expt":"Some turbulence."},{"w":"landing","pos":"word","pt":"landing","ex":"pouso","expt":"A smooth landing."},{"w":"take-off","pos":"word","pt":"take-off","ex":"decolagem","expt":"An early take-off."},{"w":"arrivals","pos":"word","pt":"arrivals","ex":"chegadas","expt":"The arrivals hall."},{"w":"departures","pos":"word","pt":"departures","ex":"partidas","expt":"The departures board."},{"w":"information desk","pos":"word","pt":"information desk","ex":"balcão de informações","expt":"Ask at the information desk."},{"w":"ticket office","pos":"word","pt":"ticket office","ex":"bilheteria","expt":"The ticket office."},{"w":"vending machine","pos":"word","pt":"vending machine","ex":"máquina de venda","expt":"A vending machine."},{"w":"carriage","pos":"word","pt":"carriage","ex":"vagão","expt":"The first carriage."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Did we miss the train?** — Perdemos o trem?","**Yes. It left at nine.** — Sim. Saiu às nove.","**What did the clerk say?** — O que o atendente disse?","**Make an appointment.** — Marque uma consulta.","**Can I reschedule?** — Posso remarcar?","**Something came up.** — Surgiu um imprevisto.","**I’ll be there in ten minutes.** — Chego em dez minutos."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"turn","pt":"virar","forms":[["I / you / we / they turn","I turn left."],["he / she / it turns","She turns right."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**check out**","fazer check-out","We checked out at eleven. — Fizemos check-out às onze."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the station","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the station","lines":[["Ana","Did we miss the train?","Perdemos o trem?"],["Leo","Yes. It left at nine.","Sim. Saiu às nove."],["Ana","What did the clerk say?","O que o atendente disse?"],["Leo","There is another at ten.","Há outro às dez."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ligação entre palavras","items":[{"label":"Ligação entre palavras","note":"Consoante final liga à vogal seguinte: pick it up → pi-ki-tup.","words":["pick it up","turn it off","an apple","check in"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Tell what you did yesterday morning.","pt":"Conte.","model":"I woke at seven. I took the bus."},{"q":"Say what you saw.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I saw my friend at the station."},{"q":"Say what you made.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I made a new plan."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with irregular verbs.","model":"I woke late. I took a taxi. The train left at nine. We ate pastries. We made a new plan.","checklist":["Usei **5 irregulares**","Usei **passado**","Sequência clara"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “pastry” mean?","opts":["palavras cruzadas","massa folhada","bobo"],"ans":1,"why":"**pastry** = massa folhada."},{"q":"What does “crossword” mean?","opts":["paciência","plataforma","palavras cruzadas"],"ans":2,"why":"**crossword** = palavras cruzadas."},{"q":"What does “patience” mean?","opts":["paciência","bobo","horário (trem)"],"ans":0,"why":"**patience** = paciência."},{"q":"What does “silly” mean?","opts":["plataforma","bobo","atrasado (transporte)"],"ans":1,"why":"**silly** = bobo."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}